   <td width="267" align="left" valign="middle" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>Massive MIMO — Fundamentals</p><p>and State-of-the-Art</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>通信工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>陈睿</p></td>
