   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>通信工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>顾华玺</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="66">
   <td height="67" align="center" valign="middle"><p>10</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>EE216000</p></td>
   <td width="27" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>高级分布式架构</p></td>
   <td width="267" align="left" valign="middle"><p>Advanced distributed architecture</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>电子工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>吴家骥</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="66">
   <td height="67" align="center" valign="middle"><p>11</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>EE216001</p></td>
   <td width="27" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>机器学习中的矩阵近似与恢复</p></td>
   <td width="267" align="left" valign="middle"><p>Matrix Approximation/Recovery for Machine Learning</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>电子工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>兰岚</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="66">
   <td height="67" align="center" valign="middle"><p>12</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>EE216002</p></td>
   <td width="27" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>线性代数进阶（数值线性代数）</p></td>
   <td width="267" align="left" valign="middle"><p>Numerical Linear Algebra</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>电子工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>李林</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="66">
   <td height="67" align="center" valign="middle"><p>13</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>EE216003</p></td>
   <td width="27" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>可穿戴与植入传感器及遥感技</p><p>术应用</p></td>
   <td width="267" align="left" valign="middle"><p>Wearables,implants and remote sensing</p><p>technologies enabled by Machine learning</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>电子工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>任爱锋</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="66">
   <td height="67" align="center" valign="middle"><p>14</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>EE216004</p></td>
   <td width="27" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>雷达检测理论</p></td>
   <td width="267" align="left" valign="middle"><p>Radar Detection Theory</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>电子工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>严俊坤</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="66">
   <td height="67" align="center" valign="middle"><p>15</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>EE216005</p></td>
   <td width="27" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>遥感大数据科学和人工智能技术基础</p></td>
   <td width="267" align="left" valign="middle"><p>Remote sensing big data and artificial</p><p>intelligence</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>电子工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>全英汇</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="66">
   <td height="67" align="center" valign="middle"><p>16</p></td>
